ly to the outstanding amount after the due date, not the Total Amount Due.", "version": "2025-11-28"}, "score": -5.779639720916748}]}}, "slice_on": {"content": [{"annotations": null, "meta": null, "text": "{\n  \"variable\": \"WS-WORKING-DAYS\",\n  \"scoped_program\": \"CLOSPEN1\",\n  \"statements\": [\n    {\n      \"ref\": {\n        \"program\": \"CLOSPEN1\",\n        \"paragraph\": null,\n        \"line_start\": 8,\n        \"line_end\": 8\n      },\n      \"text\": \"05  WS-ELAPSED-DAYS       PIC 9(4) VALUE ZERO.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ref\": {\n        \"program\": \"CLOSPEN1\",\n        \"paragraph\": null,\n        \"line_start\": 9,\n        \"line_end\": 9\n      },\n      \"text\": \"05  WS-WEEKEND-DAYS       PIC 9(4) VALUE ZERO.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ref\": {\n        \"program\": \"CLOSPEN1\",\n        \"paragraph\": null,\n        \"line_start\": 10,\n        \"line_end\": 10\n      },\n      \"text\": \"05  WS-HOLIDAY-DAYS       PIC 9(4) VALUE ZERO.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ref\": {\n        \"program\": \"CLOSPEN1\",\n        \"paragraph\": null,\n        \"line_start\": 12,\n        \"line_end\": 12\n      },\n      \"text\": \"05  WS-WORKING-DAYS       PIC S9(5) VALUE ZERO.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ref\": {\n        \"program\": \"CLOSPEN1\",\n        \"paragraph\": \"1000-MAIN\",\n        \"line_start\": 19,\n        \"line_end\": 19\n      },\n      \"text\": \"ACCEPT WS-ELAPSED-DAYS\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ref\": {\n        \"program\": \"CLOSPEN1\",\n        \"paragraph\": \"1000-MAIN\",\n        \"line_start\": 20,\n        \"line_end\": 20\n      },\n      \"text\": \"ACCEPT WS-WEEKEND-DAYS\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ref\": {\n        \"program\": \"CLOSPEN1\",\n        \"paragraph\": \"1000-MAIN\",\n        \"line_start\": 21,\n        \"line_end\": 21\n      },\n      \"text\": \"ACCEPT WS-HOLIDAY-DAYS\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ref\": {\n        \"program\": \"CLOSPEN1\",\n        \"paragraph\": \"1000-MAIN\",\n        \"line_star